<https://flowfram.com/models/model_default> a ns1:FRAMModel ;
    rdfs:comment "<p>FRAM model for Li &amp; Huang (2025) — Risk-accident emergence and prevention method of high-speed railway system. Case study: 7.23 Ningbo-Wenzhou railway accident. 20 functional modules covering pre-departure preparation, in-transit operation, and arrival management.</p><p><b>Method:</b> Risk Pulse + Site Percolation + Causal Emergence</p><p><b>Source:</b> Reliability Engineering and System Safety, 264, 111438</p>" ;
    ns1:analysisType "prospective" ;
