supposed to produce or achieve, and it serves as Input, Precondition, Resource, 
Control, or Time for downstream functions.
Examples: A product, a decision, information, a state change, a treated patient.""" ;
    ns1:aspectCode "O" ;
    ns1:aspectType "Output" ;
    ns1:hasCoupling <https://flowfram.com/models/coupling_13d223cc_c186_4cae_92ec_a3efb9c44c9e> ;
    ns1:semanticRole "The result or product of the function's execution" .

